  "prefLabel": "Box 102.03 Deputy Inspectors",
  "priorExpiration": "1994-05-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Box 102.03 Deputy Inspectors. When no commission member is available to attend a bout or exhibition, or when the size or location of an event requires additional representatives, the commission shall appoint one or more official representatives designated as deputy inspectors, who, for the duration of the event, shall have the same authority as a commissioner.\n\nSource. #4420, eff 5-24-88; EXPIRED 5-24-94\n\nNew. #6256, eff 5-25-96; ss by #10482, eff 12-5-13; ss by #14498, eff 3-1-26",
